=== Qwen Slurp Proxy Server ===
Mode: guest (UI only — login required)

Server listening on http://127.0.0.1:3008

Endpoints:
  GET  /v1/models              — OpenAI: list models
  POST /v1/chat/completions     — OpenAI: chat (stream supported)
  GET  /health                  — server status
  GET  /                        — Qwen Web UI (real SPA)
  GET  /c/:chatId               — Qwen Web UI (specific chat)

Usage:
  Open http://127.0.0.1:3008/ in your browser
